    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have You Been Waiting for a Modern Take on Classic Asteroid Shooters?</strong> \ud83d\ude80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wait might just be over! <i>Astro Busters</i> brings you a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics, responsive controls, and thrilling arcade action. Take on missions, upgrade your weapons and ships, and battle fierce enemies in deep space solo or in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q3 2025 \u2013 Early Access Launch with 3 levels, new weapons and more at a lower price. \ud83d\ude80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dec 2025 \u2013 Full Release with multiplayer, AI enemies and more at a higher price.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Also coming on Android!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to blast asteroids on the go with touchscreen controls? Try <strong><i>Astro Busters</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>on Google Play when released and experience the action on your phone or tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Demo is already released! Visit our website for the link)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea to create this game came from playing old incredibly fun classics like Asteroids, Gravity force and X-Pilot for endless hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we couldn't really find a modern version of those games and we really wanted to play such a game both solo and with our friends in multiplayer we decided to develop it ourselves ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that you will like it as much as we do ! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have You Been Waiting for a Modern Take on Classic Asteroid Shooters?</strong> \ud83d\ude80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wait might just be over! <i>Astro Busters</i> brings you a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics, responsive controls, and thrilling arcade action. Take on missions, upgrade your weapons and ships, and battle fierce enemies in deep space solo or in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q3 2025 \u2013 Early Access Launch with 3 levels, new weapons and more at a lower price. \ud83d\ude80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dec 2025 \u2013 Full Release with multiplayer, AI enemies and more at a higher price.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Also coming on Android!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to blast asteroids on the go with touchscreen controls? Try <strong><i>Astro Busters</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>on Google Play when released and experience the action on your phone or tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Demo is already released! Visit our website for the link)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea to create this game came from playing old incredibly fun classics like Asteroids, Gravity force and X-Pilot for endless hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we couldn't really find a modern version of those games and we really wanted to play such a game both solo and with our friends in multiplayer we decided to develop it ourselves ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that you will like it as much as we do ! </p>",
    "short_description": "Have You Been Waiting for a Modern Take on Classic Asteroid Shooters? \ud83d\ude80 Your wait might just be over! Astro Busters brings you a fun space shooter with realistic physics, responsive controls and thrilling arcade action. Take on missions, upgrade your weapons, ships and fight solo or in multiplayer.",
